  "pitch_paragraph": "A record with a real build in it — the pre-choruses pull back and hold there for a full thirteen seconds before each chorus arrives at near-maximum, so the hook lands as a genuine release rather than just the next section. The final chorus runs thirty-five seconds straight to the end with no wind-down, coming out of a bridge that drops the floor to a third of full height. The topline works across a full octave from C4 to C5 and reaches F5, with a low of F3, which gives a natural split between a comfortable lower part and a lead that can sit up top. Bright, light on the bottom, and it sits forward on a phone speaker.",
